  <graph edgedefault="undirected">
    <node id="&quot;EDRINE DAMULIRA&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Edrine Damulira is a researcher who has conducted extensive research at Riga Stradiņš University and Erciyes University, driven by a passion for discovery and innovation."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0229</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RIGA STRADIŅŠ UNIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Riga Stradiņš University is a university where Edrine Damulira spent time studying and conducting research, known for its rich history and contributions to science and medicine."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0229</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;MOUNT ERCIYES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Mount Erciyes is a mountain in Turkey where Erciyes University is located, symbolizing the setting of Edrine Damulira's later academic pursuits."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0229</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ERCIYES UNIVERSITY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"ORGANIZATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Erciyes University is a Turkish public university where Edrine Damulira has conducted research, known for its interdisciplinary approach and commitment to innovation."&lt;SEP&gt;"Erciyes University is an educational institution known for its interdisciplinary research, focus on real-world problems, and fostering a culture of innovation."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0229</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;TURKEY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Turkey is the country where Erciyes University is located, representing the geographical context of Edrine Damulira's later academic work."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0229</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;KAYSERI&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Kayseri is a historic city in Turkey where Erciyes University is situated, providing a specific location for Edrine Damulira's academic base."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0229</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;ORCID IDENTIFIER 0000-0002-6734-0304&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"CONCEPT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The ORCID identifier is a unique digital fingerprint used to authenticate Edrine Damulira's presence in the academic realm, tracking her research and publications."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0229</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;DIMLY LIT CAFÉ&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The dimly lit café is a place where Edrine Damulira sits, reflecting on her academic journey."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0229</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;LUKEWARM CUP OF COFFEE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"A lukewarm cup of coffee is a detail that Edrine Damulira is sipping while reflecting on her academic journey."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0229</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;AUTUMN MORNING&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"EVENT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"An autumn morning is the time when Edrine first stepped onto the Riga Stradiņš University campus, marking the beginning of her academic journey."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0229</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;IMPOSING FAÇADE&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The imposing façade of the university's main building is a physical feature that draws Edrine in with an otherworldly allure."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0229</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;INTRICATE STONE CARVINGS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Intricate stone carvings are decorative elements on the university's main building that whisper secrets of the past."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0229</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;GRAND CLOCK TOWER&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The grand clock tower is a prominent feature of the university's main building that draws Edrine in with an otherworldly allure."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0229</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RUSTLING LEAVES&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Rustling leaves are a natural element that serve as a gentle reminder of the journey ahead as Edrine makes her way to her first lecture."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0229</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;PROFESSOR JĀNIS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"PERSON"</data>
      <data key="d1">"Professor Jānis is Edrine's thesis advisor who regales her with stories of the university's rich history."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0229</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;UNIVERSITY'S LIBRARY&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"LOCATION"</data>
      <data key="d1">"The university's library is a place where Edrine spent countless hours pouring over research papers and scribbling notes."</data>
      <data key="d2">cb-0229</data>
    </node>
    <node id="&quot;RESEARCH PAPERS&quot;">
      <data key="d0">"OBJECT"</data>
